---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="ProofDesk Intake — Next Steps" description="Submit your evidence materials for AnchorForge ProofDesk intake. Learn what to send, how to package it, turnaround windows, and what happens next.">

<section style="padding-top: 180px; min-height: 80vh;">
  <div class="container narrow" style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5vw;">

    <!-- SHARED HERO -->
    <div class="eyebrow">ProofDesk Intake</div>
    <h1 class="pd-h1">Your ProofDesk run<br>has started.</h1>
    <p class="pd-sub">Now send the folder. We'll turn the mess into a sealed review packet another human can trust and inspect.</p>

    <div class="pd-cta-row">
      <a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com?subject=ProofDesk%20Intake" class="btn-buy">Email your evidence →</a>
      <a href="#what-to-send" class="pd-link">What should I send? ↓</a>
    </div>

    <p class="pd-note">Use the same email address you used at checkout if possible. If not, include your payment email in the message.</p>

    <!-- TIER-SPECIFIC SECTION -->
    <div id="tier-content"></div>

    <!-- SHARED: WHAT TO SEND -->
    <div id="what-to-send" class="pd-layer">
      <div class="eyebrow">Accepted materials</div>
      <p class="pd-lead">Send the mess. Do not spend six hours making it pretty first. ProofDesk exists because evidence usually arrives messy.</p>
      <div class="pd-two-col">
        <div>
          <h4>File types</h4>
          <ul class="pd-checklist">
            <li>PDFs</li><li>Screenshots</li><li>Photos</li><li>Scans</li>
            <li>Word docs</li><li>Google Doc exports</li><li>Spreadsheets</li>
            <li>Emails or email exports</li><li>Receipts</li><li>Invoices</li>
            <li>Contracts</li><li>Code files</li><li>GitHub exports</li>
            <li>Logs</li><li>AI chats</li><li>Prompt/output records</li>
            <li>Citations</li><li>Timelines</li><li>Notes</li>
            <li>Audio/video transcripts</li><li>ZIP archives</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Helpful context</h4>
          <ul class="pd-checklist pd-context">
            <li>What are you trying to prove?</li>
            <li>Who needs to review this?</li>
            <li>What is the deadline?</li>
            <li>Which files matter most?</li>
            <li>Which claims feel weakest?</li>
            <li>Are there known disputes?</li>
            <li>Is anything confidential?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SHARED: LARGE FILES -->
    <div class="pd-layer">
      <div class="eyebrow">How to send large files</div>
      <div class="pd-cards-3">
        <div class="pd-card-sm"><h3>Email</h3><p>Best for files under 25MB.</p></div>
        <div class="pd-card-sm"><h3>Cloud link</h3><p>Google Drive, Dropbox, OneDrive, iCloud, or WeTransfer. Enable download access.</p></div>
        <div class="pd-card-sm"><h3>Large / sensitive</h3><p>Email first with a short description. We'll coordinate a safer handoff path.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="pd-note">Recommended intake size: under 10GB. Larger packets accepted by coordination.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- SHARED: WHAT YOU RECEIVE -->
    <div class="pd-layer">
      <div class="eyebrow">Your final packet</div>
      <div class="pd-outputs">
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>MANIFEST.tsv</strong><span>Every file indexed.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>SHA256SUMS.txt</strong><span>Cryptographic checksums.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>CHAIN_OF_CUSTODY.md</strong><span>When, where, how assembled.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>CLAIM_REVIEW_TABLE.md</strong><span>Claims mapped to evidence.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>RISK_REGISTER.md</strong><span>Weak claims and gaps named.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>HANDOFF_MEMO.md</strong><span>Plain-English reviewer summary.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>source/</strong><span>Preserved copy of materials.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>sealed .zip</strong><span>Final packet archive.</span></div>
        <div class="pd-output"><strong>optional binder</strong><span>Printable if requested.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SHARED: BOUNDARIES -->
    <div class="pd-layer">
      <div class="eyebrow">Important boundaries</div>
      <div class="pd-boundary">
        <p><strong>ProofDesk is proof operations.</strong></p>
        <p>It is not legal advice. It is not patent filing. It is not attorney representation. It is not a guarantee that a claim is legally valid.</p>
        <p>We organize, hash, review, flag, summarize, and seal the evidence packet so the next human can inspect it faster.</p>
        <p>If you need legal advice, patent strategy, litigation support, or filing decisions, give the finished packet to a qualified attorney.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SHARED: PRIVACY -->
    <div class="pd-layer">
      <div class="eyebrow">Privacy and retention</div>
      <div class="pd-privacy">
        <p>We handle evidence as operational material, not public content. Do not send materials you are not authorized to share.</p>
        <p>Unless otherwise arranged, we retain working materials only as long as needed to complete the packet and resolve delivery/support issues.</p>
        <p><strong>For highly sensitive materials, contact us before sending files.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <div class="pd-final">
      <h2>Bring the folder.<br>Leave with receipts.</h2>
      <a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com?subject=ProofDesk%20Intake" class="btn-buy">Email ProofDesk Intake →</a>
      <p class="pd-note" style="margin-top: 24px;">Questions? <a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com" style="color: var(--amber);">ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
(function() {
  const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  const tier = params.get('tier') || 'generic';
  const el = document.getElementById('tier-content');
  if (!el) return;

  const tiers = {
    starter: {
      badge: 'Starter Proof Seal',
      title: 'Starter Proof Seal intake',
      promise: 'Small folder. Fast seal. Clean receipts.',
      subject: 'ProofDesk%20Intake%20%E2%80%94%20Starter',
      cta: 'Send your Starter folder →',
      cards: [
        { heading: 'What to send', body: '<p>Send one folder or ZIP containing the source materials you want indexed and sealed.</p><p>Include a short note answering:</p><ul><li>What is this packet for?</li><li>Who needs to review it?</li><li>Is there a deadline?</li><li>Is there anything we should treat as especially important?</li></ul>' },
        { heading: 'Best for', body: '<p>Starter is best for small evidence sets:</p><ul><li>Receipts</li><li>Screenshots</li><li>PDFs</li><li>Source copies</li><li>Basic timelines</li><li>Simple proof folders</li></ul>' },
        { heading: 'Turnaround', body: '<p>3–5 business days after we confirm access to your materials.</p>' },
        { heading: 'What you receive', body: '<p>Your final packet includes:</p><ul><li>MANIFEST.tsv</li><li>SHA256SUMS.txt</li><li>CHAIN_OF_CUSTODY.md</li><li>Preserved source copy</li><li>Sealed ZIP archive</li><li>Short intake summary</li></ul>' },
      ],
    },
    founder: {
      badge: 'Founder Review Packet',
      title: 'Founder Review Packet intake',
      promise: 'Your launch claims, client evidence, or investor packet becomes review-ready.',
      subject: 'ProofDesk%20Intake%20%E2%80%94%20Founder',
      cta: 'Send your Founder packet →',
      cards: [
        { heading: 'What to send', body: '<p>Send the folder plus a short list of the claims you need supported.</p><p>Include:</p><ul><li>Top 3–10 claims you need backed</li><li>Target reviewer: investor / client / partner / agency / internal</li><li>Deadline</li><li>Weakest or most disputed claim</li></ul>' },
        { heading: 'Best for', body: '<p>Founder is best for:</p><ul><li>Launch claims</li><li>Product evidence</li><li>Client reports</li><li>AI agency output</li><li>Consulting packets</li><li>Investor materials</li></ul>' },
        { heading: 'Turnaround', body: '<p>2–3 business days after we confirm access to your materials.</p>' },
        { heading: 'What you receive', body: '<p>Your final packet includes:</p><ul><li>CLAIM_REVIEW_TABLE.md</li><li>RISK_REGISTER.md</li><li>HANDOFF_MEMO.md</li><li>MANIFEST.tsv</li><li>SHA256SUMS.txt</li><li>CHAIN_OF_CUSTODY.md</li><li>Sealed archive</li></ul>' },
      ],
    },
    binder: {
      badge: 'Patent / AI Evidence Binder',
      title: 'Patent / AI Evidence Binder intake',
      promise: 'Your invention timeline and AI-assisted research become a structured evidence binder.',
      subject: 'ProofDesk%20Intake%20%E2%80%94%20Binder',
      cta: 'Send your Binder materials →',
      extraBoundary: 'ProofDesk does not file patents or provide legal advice. The binder is for attorney/expert review.',
      cards: [
        { heading: 'What to send', body: '<p>Send all invention notes, dated files, AI chats, prompt logs, model outputs, screenshots, citations, code, diagrams, and drafts.</p><p>Include:</p><ul><li>Invention/project name</li><li>Earliest known date</li><li>Major milestones</li><li>People involved</li><li>Top technical claims</li><li>Known prior art or competing systems</li><li>Attorney/reviewer deadline if any</li></ul>' },
        { heading: 'Best for', body: '<p>Binder is best for:</p><ul><li>Patent prep</li><li>AI-assisted research</li><li>Invention timelines</li><li>Model-output evidence</li><li>Technical claims</li><li>Code, citations, screenshots</li></ul>' },
        { heading: 'Turnaround', body: '<p>5–7 business days after we confirm access to your materials.</p>' },
        { heading: 'What you receive', body: '<p>Your final packet includes:</p><ul><li>Chronology</li><li>Claim/evidence mapping</li><li>RISK_REGISTER.md</li><li>HANDOFF_MEMO.md (for attorney/expert)</li><li>MANIFEST.tsv</li><li>SHA256SUMS.txt</li><li>CHAIN_OF_CUSTODY.md</li><li>Sealed binder</li><li>Optional printable binder</li></ul>' },
      ],
    },
    emergency: {
      badge: 'Emergency ProofDesk Run',
      title: 'Emergency ProofDesk intake',
      promise: 'Priority proof operations for urgent review.',
      subject: 'ProofDesk%20Intake%20%E2%80%94%20EMERGENCY',
      cta: 'Send Emergency intake →',
      extraInstructions: '<div class="pd-emergency-warn">Pause edits if possible. Preserve originals. Send what exists now.</div><div class="pd-emergency-box"><strong>Do not:</strong><ul><li>Reorganize for hours</li><li>Overwrite originals</li><li>Keep editing screenshots</li></ul><p>Send the raw folder and a plain-English explanation.</p></div>',
      cards: [
        { heading: 'What to send first', body: '<p>Send these five things immediately:</p><ol><li>Deadline</li><li>What happened</li><li>What needs to be proven</li><li>Link to evidence folder</li><li>Best phone/email for rapid clarification</li></ol>' },
        { heading: 'Best for', body: '<p>Emergency is for:</p><ul><li>Urgent disputes</li><li>Hard deadlines</li><li>Takedowns</li><li>Launch problems</li><li>Investor requests</li><li>Legal prep under pressure</li></ul>' },
        { heading: 'Turnaround', body: '<p>24-hour priority target after we confirm access.</p>' },
        { heading: 'What you receive', body: '<p>Your final packet includes:</p><ul><li>Priority triage</li><li>Risk flags</li><li>Fast claim map</li><li>HANDOFF_MEMO.md</li><li>CHAIN_OF_CUSTODY.md</li><li>Sealed archive</li></ul>' },
      ],
    },
  };

  const t = tiers[tier];
  if (!t) {
    el.innerHTML = '<div class="pd-layer"><div class="pd-fallback"><div class="eyebrow">Which tier?</div><p>Not sure which tier you purchased? Email <a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com" style="color:var(--amber);">ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com</a> with your payment receipt and project name.</p><div class="pd-cards-3"><a href="?tier=starter" class="pd-card-sm"><h3>Starter</h3><p>$149 — Small folder, fast seal</p></a><a href="?tier=founder" class="pd-card-sm"><h3>Founder</h3><p>$499 — Claims + review packet</p></a><a href="?tier=binder" class="pd-card-sm"><h3>Binder</h3><p>$999 — Patent / AI evidence</p></a><a href="?tier=emergency" class="pd-card-sm"><h3>Emergency</h3><p>$1,999 — 24-hour priority</p></a></div></div></div>';
    return;
  }

  let html = '<div class="pd-layer">';
  html += '<div class="pd-tier-badge">' + t.badge + '</div>';
  html += '<h2 class="pd-tier-title">' + t.title + '</h2>';
  html += '<p class="pd-tier-promise">' + t.promise + '</p>';

  if (t.extraInstructions) html += t.extraInstructions;

  html += '<div class="pd-card-grid">';
  for (var i = 0; i < t.cards.length; i++) {
    var c = t.cards[i];
    html += '<div class="pd-icard"><h3>' + c.heading + '</h3>' + c.body + '</div>';
  }
  html += '</div>';

  if (t.extraBoundary) {
    html += '<div class="pd-boundary" style="margin-top:24px;"><p>' + t.extraBoundary + '</p></div>';
  }

  html += '<div style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="mailto:ProofDeskService@aiitcorp.com?subject=' + t.subject + '" class="btn-buy">' + t.cta + '</a></div>';
  html += '</div>';

  el.innerHTML = html;
})();
</script>

<style>
  .pd-h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5.5vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .pd-sub {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .pd-cta-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pd-link {
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.3);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .pd-note {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .pd-layer { margin-top: 64px; }
  .pd-lead { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }

  /* Tier-specific styles */
  .pd-tier-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.15);
    color: #a78bfa;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pd-tier-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .pd-tier-promise {
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .pd-tier-section {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .pd-tier-section p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .pd-tier-section ul { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; }
  .pd-tier-section ol { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; }
  .pd-tier-section li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

  .pd-card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .pd-icard {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.15);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .pd-icard h3 {
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pd-icard p {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .pd-icard p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .pd-icard ul, .pd-icard ol {
    color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pd-icard li { margin-bottom: 4px; }

  .pd-turnaround-single {
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pd-emergency-warn {
    background: rgba(220, 60, 60, 0.12);
    border-left: 3px solid #dc3c3c;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    color: #ff8888;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .pd-emergency-box {
    background: rgba(220, 60, 60, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(220, 60, 60, 0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .pd-emergency-box strong { color: #ff8888; }
  .pd-emergency-box ul { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); padding-left: 20px; }
  .pd-emergency-box p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; }

  /* Shared components */
  .pd-cards-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .pd-card-sm {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .pd-card-sm h3 { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .pd-card-sm p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.5; }

  .pd-two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) { .pd-two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .pd-two-col h4 {
    color: var(--amber, #D4AF37);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .pd-checklist { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .pd-checklist li { padding: 3px 0; color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.83rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
  .pd-context li { font-style: italic; padding: 5px 0; }

  .pd-outputs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-top: 16px; }

  .pd-output {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .pd-output strong { color: var(--amber, #D4AF37); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 0.83rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .pd-output span { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.78rem; text-align: right; }

  .pd-boundary {
    padding: 24px;
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.4);
    background: rgba(212, 164, 55, 0.04);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .pd-boundary p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .pd-boundary p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .pd-boundary strong { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); }

  .pd-privacy {
    padding: 20px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212,164,55,0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .pd-privacy p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .pd-privacy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .pd-privacy strong { color: var(--cream, #E8E0D4); }

  .pd-final { margin-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 80px; text-align: center; }
  .pd-final h2 { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem); margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.2; }

  .pd-fallback { margin-top: 16px; }
  .pd-fallback p { color: var(--slate, #8A9AB5); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 24px; }
</style>

</Layout>
